{"id":401810001,"chapter_id":52001,"scene_id":52017,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>世有英杰，逐日而歌；非有神材，良弓难张。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401810001_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_18100","style":3,"background":4246,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>凡卉常木，柘檍桑橘；欲觅神种，若木扶桑。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401810001_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_18100","style":3,"background":4246,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"烟烟","content":"为了击败金乌，需要造出一把绝世神弓，打造神弓的第一步——就是要“通天若木”的树枝！","voice":["vo_event_401810001_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_18100","style":1,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"烟烟摇头晃脑地一边朗诵着诗歌一边向你讲解。","style":3,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"选项","options":["太玄乎了","……"],"jump":[8,8],"style":6,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"玩家","content":"狄斯城没有“通天若木”这种东西。","style":2,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"烟烟","content":"说什么呢，我已经看到啦，就在那边——","voice":["vo_event_401810001_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_18100","style":1,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"东洲少女指向高塔黑环的废墟，拔地而起的残像高可通天，跟你以前见过的模样确实有些不同，恍惚间竟真有些“通天神木”的样子。","style":3,"background":2183,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"你想起FAC提到过，金乌逼近内海后，这个灰烬使徒与第零黑环发生共鸣，导致城内出现大范围狂厄异变，三个黑环废墟都有异常。","style":3,"background":2183,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"你移回目光，不管这神话是真是假，去调查这黑环废墟的异变也是必要的。","style":3,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"选项","options":["那就出发吧"],"jump":[15],"style":6,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"烟烟","content":"等等！${PlayerName}哥哥，在出发前，还有一件重要的事——","female_content":"等等！${PlayerName}姐姐，在出发前，还有一件重要的事——","voice":["vo_event_401810001_18","vo_event_401810001_18f"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_18100","style":1,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"选项","options":["……什么事？"],"jump":[17],"style":6,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"烟烟","content":"烟烟给你带来了一个<color=#fb9259>小·礼·物</color>——","voice":["vo_event_401810001_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_18100","style":1,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"她上下打量着你，嘿嘿笑着比划来比划去，你有种不祥的预感。","style":3,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"她哗啦哗啦地从包里翻出一套衣服，兴高采烈地套在了你的身上，甚至还拿出了一面小镜子让你看看穿完之后的样子。","style":3,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……","style":1,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"烟烟","content":"这是东洲使节团的礼物！上面有神君的赐福，可以消灾解难，抵御污秽！","voice":["vo_event_401810001_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_18100","style":1,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"东洲人还挺讲究仪式感的，你叹了口气。","style":3,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"选项","options":["谢谢你的礼物"],"jump":[24],"style":6,"background":2189,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"出发吧。","style":1,"background":2189,"log_type":1}]}